# Secrets — never commit.
#
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC, so a miss here is a disclosure, not an inconvenience.
# Matched as a pattern rather than by name: an exact list only covers the names
# someone already thought of, and it has been caught out twice in the gateway
# repo — first by config.py.bak-* files, then by a manual backup Windows named
# "config - Copy.py". The glob covers copies, numbered duplicates, .bak, .old
# and whatever comes next. config.example.py is negated back in because it is
# the template and holds only CHANGE_ME placeholders.
gateway/config*
!gateway/config.example.py
gateway/*.log
gateway/backups/

# Local database scratch files
*.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
